{"id":"6c238b60bfdff68b","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-simon-promise-problem.md","title":"Simon Period Promise","display":"df-simon-promise-problem — Simon Period Promise","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-simon-promise-problem","aliases":["28-df-simon-promise-problem"],"display":"df-simon-promise-problem — Simon Period Promise","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §10.5, Simon’s problem; correction of omitted reflexive alternative","source_printed_pages":"220","source_pdf_pages":"246","source_statement_verified":false,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-simon-promise-problem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-simon-promise-problem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-simon-promise-problem — Simon Period Promise"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §10.5, Simon’s problem; correction of omitted reflexive alternative"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"220"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"246"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}^n\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\setminus\\{0^n\\}\">\\(a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\setminus\\{0^n\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\oplus\">\\(\\oplus\\)</span> 为逐位模二加法。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Simon}_n\">\\(\\operatorname{Simon}_n\\)</span> 是函数与非零周期组成的关系。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Simon}_n\\coloneqq\\{(f,a)\\in(\\{0,1\\}^n)^{\\{0,1\\}^n}\\times(\\{0,1\\}^n\\setminus\\{0^n\\}):\\forall x,y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ [f(x)=f(y)\\leftrightarrow(y=x\\lor y=x\\oplus a)]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Simon}_n\\coloneqq\\{(f,a)\\in(\\{0,1\\}^n)^{\\{0,1\\}^n}\\times(\\{0,1\\}^n\\setminus\\{0^n\\}):\\forall x,y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ [f(x)=f(y)\\leftrightarrow(y=x\\lor y=x\\oplus a)]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall(f,a)\\in\\operatorname{Simon}_n\\ \\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\quad f^{-1}(\\{f(x)\\})=\\{x,x\\oplus a\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall(f,a)\\in\\operatorname{Simon}_n\\ \\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\quad f^{-1}(\\{f(x)\\})=\\{x,x\\oplus a\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书问题框漏写x=y这一反身分支，字面读法在非零周期下矛盾；这里按紧随的二元纤维算法修正。该任务为给定满足承诺的f输出唯一非零a；任取x，其同纤维的另一元素唯一，故a唯一。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.5, Simon’s problem; correction of omitted reflexive alternative；印刷页 220；PDF 页 246。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第10章的 Simon Period Promise，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}^n","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\setminus\\{0^n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\oplus","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Simon}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Simon}_n\\coloneqq\\{(f,a)\\in(\\{0,1\\}^n)^{\\{0,1\\}^n}\\times(\\{0,1\\}^n\\setminus\\{0^n\\}):\\forall x,y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ [f(x)=f(y)\\leftrightarrow(y=x\\lor y=x\\oplus a)]\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall(f,a)\\in\\operatorname{Simon}_n\\ \\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\quad f^{-1}(\\{f(x)\\})=\\{x,x\\oplus a\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1790,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-325","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-tensor-product-state]]、[[28-df-hadamard-transform]]、[[28-df-reversible-boolean-oracle]]、[[28-lem-phase-kickback]]、[[28-df-grover-iterate]]、[[28-thm-grover-success-amplitude]]、[[28-df-simon-promise-problem]]、[[28-df-quantum-fourier-transform]]、[[28-lem-nontrivial-square-root-factor]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}